{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the early 2000s, a computer engineer is sent to a remote mountain village to help local businesses. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But strange symbols and unsettling videos begin appearing on computers, followed by sudden disappearances of villagers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What begins as a routine assignment unravels into a nightmare as you descend into the mountains and confront a malicious force that blends the boundary between cyberspace and the supernatural.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First person psychological horror focused on atmosphere and slow-burn tension</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings shaped by your performance</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time-sensitive visual puzzles that intertwine with the story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tightly paced narrative</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"You Tried","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3132340/39d95c3b3793daaa133f5ac2b74dcdac10692feb.jpg"},{"name":"True Ending","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3132340/936271f090bb0e3fa7601a8d0f4a3d476a5a6918.jpg"},{"name":"Meet the Mastermind","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3132340/22800f3d5099259bd980ed9e603ac8558c130c98.jpg"}],"total":3},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3132340?t=1773446191","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3132340/a5a364a143bba9d3498967e5adaef0ea3a0c2322/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773446191","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3132340/8f9eb8c661d40519c0a0b78e7bd24f57273cd155/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=17